    "text": "By IrvingWeekly Staff ,\n1 days ago COLLEYVILLE, Texas — A residential fire in Colleyville left one adult and one child dead Saturday night, April 25th, after firefighters rescued three people from a smoke-filled home, according to the Colleyville Fire Department. Fire crews responded to the 4700 block of Bill Simmons Drive and arrived to find... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
